WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.313
This is the parent dashboard. Linda is Maya's mom. She sees each student she is linked to and how far along they are.

2
00:00:08.015 --> 00:00:23.730
Open a student to see where things stand: how complete the profile is, how many schools are matched, essays in progress, and recent activity. It is read only: parents can look, but they cannot edit. From here a parent can also manage the student's plan and billing.

3
00:00:24.447 --> 00:00:29.200
Matches show the reach, target and safety schools Mascot picked, and why.

4
00:00:29.908 --> 00:00:34.873
Essays show every draft and, when the student allows it, the feedback from their counselor.

5
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.677
The planner shows the deadlines coming up, so nothing catches the family by surprise.

6
00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:50.192
The student stays in charge. They decide what each parent sees, and they can change it at any time. Parents can suggest schools for the list, too.
